*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        applyPieri((mu, boxes), T, P)
        applyPieri(..., Convention => "Row" | "Filling" | "Weyl")
  * Inputs:
      * (mu, boxes), a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, the same data
        passed to *note pieri: pieri,
