        $\mu$.  May be a List or a Filling.  In "Row"/"Weyl" convention a List
        is the PM row form; in "Filling" convention a List is column form
        (auto-wrapped).  A Filling is always treated as column form.
      * P, a *note polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, whose
        generators carry $\mathrm{Sym}^d V$
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Convention => a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value
        "Row"
