    inclusion of representations of a general linear group
  * *note lrMap: lrMap, -- GL(V)-equivariant Littlewood-Richardson inclusion
  * *note dualPieri: dualPieri, -- GL-equivariant projection Sym^d V ⊗ S_lambda
    V --> S_mu V
