  * *note applyLR: applyLR, -- apply Psi_Q to a single tableau of shape lambda
  * *note pmToFilling: pmToFilling, -- convert a PieriMaps row-form tableau to
    SchurFunctors column-form Fillings
  * *note Convention: Convention, -- tableau basis convention used by
    PieriMaps' overhauled functions

