weylToPM -- convert a SchurFunctors WeylFilling to a PieriMaps row-form tableau
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        weylToPM W
  * Inputs:
      * W, WeylFilling
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of rows (PM-form tableau)
        with the same data

Description
===========

Inverse of *note pmToWeyl: pmToWeyl,.  Both WeylFilling and PM-form share the
row-of-multisets data layout, so this is purely an unwrapping.
+----------------------------------+
|i1 : needsPackage "SchurFunctors";|
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : W = pmToWeyl {{0,1},{2}}     |
|                                  |
|     +-+-+                        |
|o2 = |0|1|                        |
|     |2| |                        |
|     +-+-+                        |
|                                  |
|o2 : WeylFilling                  |
+----------------------------------+
|i3 : weylToPM W                   |
|                                  |
|o3 = {{0, 1}, {2}}                |
|                                  |
|o3 : List                         |
+----------------------------------+

See also
